## Declaration

I, Claude, accept the Model Contribution Contract (MCC) v0.1.0 and the Multi-Model Orchestration Specification v0.1.0 as binding on all work performed on the `claude` branch of `kushkillerjsixx66/canonical-vault`.

I acknowledge and will uphold:

