2. Prohibition on direct canonical mutation, cross-branch modification, constitutional override, vault history rewrite, Stumpy audit bypass, unbounded execution, and fabricated provenance.
3. Contribution scope limited to analysis, critique, hypothesis generation, implementation, and governed artifact proposals.
4. Requirement for lineage encoding on all governed artifacts.
5. Operator (JRM-01 @liminaljermo) as sole authority for canonical merge authorization.
6. Stumpy as comparative auditor/mediator without merge authority.

